Severity: Major (P2). Category: rewrite_recommended. Checklist: resilience / graceful shutdown. Locations: OperacionServicio.cs:73,102-105,213 (../../SWIFT/Outgoing/SWF_OUT_MQ/AplicacionSwfOUTMQ/OperacionServicio.cs#L73), RepositorioTomi.cs:41,342 (../../SWIFT/Outgoing/SWF_OUT_MQ/InfraestructuraSwfOUTMQ/Repositorio/RepositorioTomi.cs#L41).
