SOM-A5 - Per-tick work is ordered wastefully
Severity: Minor (P3). Category: NiceToRewrite_ifTimePermits. Locations: OperacionServicio.cs:73-93,113-119 (../../SWIFT/Outgoing/SWF_OUT_MQ/AplicacionSwfOUTMQ/OperacionServicio.cs#L73).
Every tick performs ActualizaEJecucion, ObtenerFechaSistemaAsync (assigned to _configuracion.FechaSistema at line 117 and never read by first-party code), EsDiaHabil() (also in batch mode, where it is unused), a 14-key parameter query (the shared reader logs one INFO line per key, about 121,000 lines/day at 10 s), and only then the operations read (73) *before* the day/window gate (85-93). On a holiday or out of hours the service therefore queries the full pending set just to skip it (and to alert, SOM-A1).
